1	/****************************************************************************
2	 * dm_wifi.c — WiFi backend aligned with official Gemini-S1 / NuttX guide
3	 *
4	 * Official connect sequence (ifconfig_cmd.md + community notes + wapi.c):
5	 *   ifup wlan0 first
6	 *   wapi mode wlan0 2          (WAPI_MODE_MANAGED)
7	 *   wapi psk wlan0 '<pass>' 3  (3 = WPA_ALG_CCMP)
8	 *   wapi essid wlan0 '<ssid>' 1 (1 = WAPI_ESSID_ON)
9	 *   renew wlan0 / netlib_obtain_ipv4addr
10	 *
11	 * Auto-connect: default Xiaomi AP + optional /data saved credentials.
12	 * Manual scan/connect UI is unchanged.
13	 * Official scan: wapi scan → escan_init + scan_stat + scan_coll
14	 * All work runs in a pthread (never on LVGL thread).
15	 ****************************************************************************/
